            subtitle: `Alba buys a brewery's bottles for two years: how to compare offers, how much volume to give each supplier, the contract, the inspection, the invoices, the follow-up and a capacity cut at the main supplier. The cheapest supplier can turn out dear through lead time and reliability.`,
